  "description": "Lee Yoo, an ordinary aspiring actor, abandons his stable civil service job to chase his dreams. After enduring a series of crushing failures, he finds himself at the brink of giving up. Just then, a popular vlogger offers him a lucrative acting gig with a catch: Yoo must pretend to be his boyfriend. What begins as a simple business arrangement soon blurs the lines between fantasy and reality, leaving both men questioning what is genuine as their on-screen romance starts to feel all too real.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
